===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno}} {{term|peridou|lang=fro}}, {{term|peridout}}, {{etyl|frm}} {{term|perido|lang=frm}}, {{term|peridon}}, of uncertain origin; later reborrowed from modern {{etyl|fr}} {{term|péridot|lang=fr}}.
[[Image:Olivine (peridot).jpg|thumb|Peridot]]

