===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A transparent olive-[[green]] form of [[olivine]], used as a [[gem]].
#* '''2004''', {{w|Richard Fortey}}, ''The Earth'', Folio Society 2011, p. 51:
#*: Gem-quality olivine is known as '''peridot''', which has a subtle green light all its own.

